WEBVTT

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:06.450
Akarin!

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:07.830
Hey~

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:26.000
Yuru Yuri's starting again.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.170
Hold it right there, junior high schooler!

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.800
Really, don't you make that dull face the first period on Monday!

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.390
Go and par-take this whole par-tay!

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:37.970
C'mon spill it out, your juice and your smile!

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:40.100
Yu Yu Yu Yuru Yuri Yes!

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:49.940
Light and fluffy yuri ooh~ Three! Yeah!

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:55.240
Our days are so much slower, we're having a comfy lie-in...

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.660
Which turns to oversleeping! Ack?! Oh no!

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:00.330
Dash! Dash! Dash! Dash!

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:05.750
Dear oh dear, just doze it off right through the lesson.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.000
But eventually for whom the school bell chimes?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.790
To us, maidens, after class!

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.550
Ah, we won't stop.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.420
The snacks and aimless talk and being lazy.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:18.090
With you always.

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:21.430
Laughing together.

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:23.100
I love this time so much!

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.770
Let's laugh till our brains explode.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.730
While chomping on seasoned rice crisps.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:33.690
Well, we'll work out something, it'll be all right!

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:36.200
Let's flash that amazing smile!

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.200
Just kidding! And thank you!

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:45.040
No matter what, let today be the most fun day ever!

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.660
(Yay! One more time!)

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:50.080
Hold it right there, junior high schooler!

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.710
The usual suspects have gathered!

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.460
Yu Yu Yu Yuru Yuri Yes!

00:01:56.010 --> 00:02:01.010
<b>The Protagonist Returns</b>

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:06.730
I'm Akaza Akari.

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:09.480
I'm the sort of super-normal middle schooler you might find anywhere.

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:18.780
Despite that, I find every day very fulfilling.

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:21.030
Because...

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:23.240
Because...

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.700
Good morning, everyone.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.540
Akari-chan!
Akari!

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.210
Good morning!

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.090
Because everyone loves me!

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:36.920
Akari, your buns look cool again today.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:37.970
Can I touch them?

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.430
Kyouko, you just touched them the other day!

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:41.930
It's my turn today!

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.100
That's not fair!

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.430
I still haven't touched them yet!

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:50.350
The cute little kittens are fighting over me again, today.

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:53.560
I'm such a naughty girl.

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:56.190
Akari, come sleep over at my place sometime.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:58.360
Yui-senpai, no!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.740
Akari-chan's staying with me!

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:01.580
Not fair!

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:05.650
I want to watch Mirakurun alone with Akari!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:08.480
Now, now...

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:12.210
I'll sleep over at each of your houses.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:12.790
Really?

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.690
So...

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.630
No fighting!

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.840
Akari-chan, you're so wonderful!
Akari, you're so wonderful!

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.470
Shall we go to school?

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:27.850
Wait, Akari-chan!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:31.270
I want to hold your hand...

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.180
Stop!

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:34.150
I'll be holding her hand!

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.940
No, I will!

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.640
Come on, now.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:39.690
I don't have three hands.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.320
So,

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.970
Kyouko-chan, you get my thumb.

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:46.240
Yui-chan, you get my pointer finger.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.490
Chinatsu-chan, you get my middle finger.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.450
Now you can all hold my hand.

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:51.970
I'm so happy!

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:53.420
But seems it'd be hard to walk, though.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:57.380
By the way, this is what you call Fleming's left hand rule.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.460
Akari-chan, you know everything!
Akari, you know everything!

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.220
Just ask me if there's anything you don't know.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.430
Okay, then!

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.550
Why is the sky blue?

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:13.850
Because you're all so cute!

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.480
Akari-chan, you're so wonderful!
Akari, you're so wonderful!

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.860
I'll see you two later.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:24.700
See you after school.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:29.580
Chinatsu-chan's lucky Akari's in her class.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.750
We're finally alone, Akari-chan...

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.830
Something smells sour!

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.050
Oh, it's those pickles.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.880
Oh, good!

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:49.000
I thought your feet might be stinky.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:53.060
There's a person who sometimes gives me pickles.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:58.310
I'm sure someone wonderful is watching over me from somewhere.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:05.990
I secretly gave her my pickles, home-made and full of love.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.030
Now she will know how I feel.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:12.700
Ikeda-senpai, your pickles are always amazing.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:15.830
I wish I could pickle some with you!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.630
You can pickle me.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.050
It's too much!

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:25.010
I didn't know there was a fountain there.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:28.640
It's so great to watch a red fountain with Akari-chan!

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:31.260
Good morning, everyone...

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.850
Akari-chan!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.150
What do you think you're doing?

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:42.480
I do not want your stifling behaviour ruining...

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.360
...my wonderfully fresh morning with Akaza-san!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:46.950
What'd you say?

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:50.700
Sakurako-chan, Himawari-chan! Good morning.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.200
You both seem lively today.

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:56.560
Akari-chan!

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.710
You can give me a good morning kiss, if you want!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.920
You can kiss me, too!

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:05.300
What will I do with you kittens?

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:13.180
That will have to do.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:17.270
It's not like I'm happy or anything...

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.020
You can do that every day!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.360
Akaza Akari!

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:28.400
What was that?

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.170
Sugiura-senpai is so shy...

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:33.280
Oh, right.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:35.580
I baked some cookies.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.330
They're shaped like my face!

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.920
They were left over.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.780
Thank you.

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:45.340
Thanks for the food.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.840
They're delicious!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:54.560
It's just like you to start eating from your trademark buns!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.140
I want to see you do <i>that</i> again.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:58.180
Your "Akarin"!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.940
Akarin~
Your "Akarin"!

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:01.730
Akarin~

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.400
But if I do that,
Akarin~

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:06.520
you won't be able to see my cute face anymore.
Akarin~

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:07.440
I see.
Akarin~

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.860
Akarin~

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.320
Oh, you're hopeless.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.130
What?

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:14.160
You're really gonna do it?

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:14.600
Akarin~

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:16.410
Just today!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.160
Akarin!

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.410
Akari-san, you're so talented!
Akari-chan, you're so talented!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:24.710
I'm a naughty girl at school, too.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:27.590
My time doesn't end after school, either.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:28.670
That's right.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:32.720
I am the brightest star of the Amusement Club.

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:35.600
Akari's here!

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.930
You're late, Akari-chan.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:40.100
I thought you weren't coming.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:42.730
Sorry, sorry.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.770
What are we doing today?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.360
Today, we're doing...

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:46.770
<b><i>We Love Akari-chan</i></b>

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.110
Tada!
<b><i>We Love Akari-chan</i></b>

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:50.490
What's this?

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:53.570
The three of us made it.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.120
With all our love...

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.620
Will you eat it?

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:58.120
Of course I will!

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.960
It's delicious.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.090
Akari-chan, you're so awesome!

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:11.050
You've made a mess of your cute face, Akari.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.880
Thank you, Yui-chan.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:16.390
I was going to do that!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:24.400
Akari-chan, your cheek is so sweet.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.360
You naughty little kitten!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:33.780
I made something good, too!

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:39.030
This is the Akari and Mirakurun doujinshi I wrote!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:40.290
Here!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.410
Thank you, Kyouko-chan!

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.270
Um...

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:48.540
Akari, I love you!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.300
Kyouko-chan...

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.100
I love you, too!

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:56.550
I love you too, Akari...

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:58.010
Everyone...

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.220
Akaza Akari!

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:03.560
I love you, too!

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.480
Hold it right there!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:09.110
I also love you, Akaza-san!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.190
Those pickles... Ikeda-senpai!

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:14.490
I love you, too!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.150
So do I!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:22.410
I love you, too.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.620
Chizuru-senpai!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.750
I love you even more than I love explosions!

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.750
Nishigaki-sensei, you too?

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:35.970
Akari!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.590
Akari-chan!

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:50.690
We'll always be together!

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.650
Akari.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.530
Hey, Akari.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:56.790
It's no use.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:57.990
She's fast asleep.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:03.330
And after Yui-senpai went through all the trouble to make lunch for us.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:04.370
Who cares?

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.750
Leth's juth let her thleep!

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:10.040
Kyouko-senpai!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.520
Don't talk with your mouth full.

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:12.420
It's bad manners.

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:14.810
Who cares?

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:16.800
Let's just let her sleep.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:17.670
I mean, look.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:20.800
She looks so happy...

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:23.100
Well, now that you mention it...

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.640
Anyway, thanks for the food.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.140
No, you don't!

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:30.150
Leave some for Akari.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:34.070
We'll always be together.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:59.930
It's so nice and beautiful.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:02.010
It's a shame it's so close to home, though!

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:06.930
We're just a bunch of middle schoolers, so we can't go far.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:10.360
I'm glad our parents let us come.

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:11.020
Yes!

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:15.020
I've been looking forward to today for a long time.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.740
I was so jealous when you went away on your school trip.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:21.990
I couldn't stand it!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.370
Did you want to take a bath with me that badly?

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:28.080
No!

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.090
B-But...

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.630
If it were with Yui-senpai...

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.650
This is relaxing.

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:46.760
Why don't we have some of these?

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:48.520
Oh, I'll have one, too.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:53.650
These are delicious.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.020
You're right.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.940
Hey!

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.740
These are good.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.530
They really are.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:08.160
I mean, no!

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:11.330
This isn't any different from being at the club room.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.250
Let's do something more hot spring-ish!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.630
What's hot spring-ish?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.590
Maybe table tennis?

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.220
Let's go with that.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.340
Think before you speak.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:34.480
Hurry up and serve.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.690
Concentrate!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:36.560
No.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.150
Geez, Akari-chan.

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.740
Sorry.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.620
Take this!

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:50.490
Killer smash!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.040
It's stuck and won't come out.

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.340
Her hair ate it!

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:05.840
I got it!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.390
I'll serve next.

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:10.070
Okay.

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.390
Bring it on.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.180
Here I go!

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:23.990
When you serve, you're supposed to make the ball bounce once on your side of the court, then your opponent's...

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:25.530
Is that right?

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:28.870
Let's try that again, then.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.040
Why do you have two?

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:42.250
So I can hit the ball whether you aim left or right!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.420
Here we go.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.090
There!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:51.600
Not... bad!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:54.140
Aren't you going to use your left hand?

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:55.430
There!

00:13:58.060 --> 00:13:59.560
I'm so sweaty.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.570
I'm thirsty.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.000
Fine, then.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.070
I'll buy you guys something to drink.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:05.860
Really?

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:08.610
I want a Pukari.

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:10.180
All right.

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.910
But just buying it for you would be too boring.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:13.370
What?

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.870
Let's push Pukari and red bean soup at the same time!

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:18.250
Pukari!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.630
I hope I get Pukari!

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:24.550
It's so hot...

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.420
Red bean soup won't quench my thirst...

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:29.470
Cheer up, Akari.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:36.980
No one could've known most vending machines prioritise the left-most product when two buttons are pushed at the same time.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.100
You knew, obviously, didn't you?

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.450
Oh, sorry.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.080
Chinatsu-chan, what do you want?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.110
What?

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:58.760
Um, Boronamin C, please.

00:14:58.760 --> 00:14:59.800
Okay.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.590
This is going well!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:09.010
I'd buy anything for you, my cute little Chinatsu-chan.

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:11.930
Yui-senpai.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:15.600
That's right, we're at the hot springs today.

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:19.100
It's the perfect opportunity to get closer to Yui-senpai!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:23.360
Yui-senpai, I've always...

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:30.030
After exercising, you should drink red
bean soup to replenish your blood sugar.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.280
Doubles

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.490
Here I go.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.200
There!

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.500
Akari.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:45.790
Sorry!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:46.840
Stop that.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:47.960
All right!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:50.340
It's about to get harder!

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.080
What?

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:53.980
You can hit two balls at once?

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.720
I'm pretty good when I'm serious.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:02.140
Here we go!

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:19.660
Yui-san, would you like us to wash each other?

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.460
I've already finished.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.130
It's no big deal!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.250
Don't go easy on me.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:36.260
Ow! I'm sorry!

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:38.100
I'll do it myself!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.440
You said not to go easy.

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.370
I can go even harder.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.320
It's cold!

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:03.710
It feels so good...

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.170
It really does.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:09.150
Miss, your skin is so smooth.

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:10.500
Kyouko-senpai?

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.660
Stop that, you idiot!

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:14.510
It's like cleaning a clam!

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:16.180
What's that supposed to mean?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.390
Oh, isn't that cute?

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:20.060
You got my joke?

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.810
Hot springs are so nice.

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:25.630
Hot springs, hot springs.

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:28.150
I'm in hot water-springs.

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:31.190
Is that one of Sugiura-senpai's jokes?

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.230
Yeah.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.190
No Angkor worries!

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.900
You'll have to pay a fine Irvine!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:38.070
I'm surprised you remember those.

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:42.330
Whiny, whiny, Mesopo-whiny-a!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:46.960
Why don't you laugh at my jokes?

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:47.580
I don't know!

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.090
Don't fight, you...

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:50.590
Huh?

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.590
How many balls did your hair eat?

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:56.510
What?

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.670
I ate too much.

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:06.740
Yui-senpai, are you going to sleep already?

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:08.730
No, I'm just resting.

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:12.730
Akari-chan really is asleep.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:15.990
Yeah, she always goes to bed at nine.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.240
At nine?

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.740
Oh, no! I forgot!

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:22.120
<b>Mirakurun 2</b>

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:26.540
Mirakurun's movie is on TV today.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:29.670
You already have the blu-rays and DVDs.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.040
I bet you're recording it, too!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.880
You don't understand.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.760
Watching it air on TV is so much fun.

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:37.880
Really?

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:40.140
Thanks for the food!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:40.930
Cabbage
Miso

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:44.100
Hooray, today's lunch is miso cabbage.
Cabbage
Miso

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:51.560
Kurumi-chan, I bought some strawberry milk and yakisoba bread.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.070
Good work, Raika-chan.

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:57.320
Since I'm a growing girl, lunch only isn't enough for me.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.860
Your lunch looks delicious.

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:03.620
I'll give you some miso as a reward.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:06.620
Hooray, I love miso!

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:10.920
That scream...

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.330
Could it be Team Giga Giga?

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.250
Could it be Ganbo-sama?

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:19.040
Kurumi-chan, something has come up...

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:20.760
S-Same here!

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.390
My skirt is getting shorter and shorter!

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.270
The gap between my socks and my skirt is so wide,

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.430
I'll never be able to get married!

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:32.480
Giga giga giga!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:35.230
I will fill this world with embarrassment!

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:39.030
I'll make you wear clothes as embarrassing as mine!

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:40.820
Stop!

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:45.200
Witch Girl Mirakurun has arrived!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.460
Kids who don't play nice will get hurt!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.290
I knew you would come.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.340
Leave this to me.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:20:00.590
Mirakurun, I'll wrap you up in a tornado of embarrassment!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:03.090
This is what I look like under my sunglasses!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.480
No!

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:06.810
Your eyes are too cute!

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:07.720
How embarrassing!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:09.600
Well?

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.190
You've done it now!

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.980
Finishing move, Mirakurun Hammer!

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.950
Ganbo-sama!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.950
You'll pay for this, Mirakurun!

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.990
My skirt's length is back to normal!

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.450
Thank you, Mirakurun!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.710
Serving out justice is a piece of cake.

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.800
I'm happy...

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:40.000
I'm so happy...

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.130
You're crying?

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:44.630
Hey, let's get into the hot spring again.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:47.010
I'm too tired.

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:48.670
Hey!

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:49.560
Don't sleep!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:51.640
Shut up.

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:53.180
Go by yourself.

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.100
Fine.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.610
I will!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.250
Chinatsu-chan.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:18.750
It's not because I thought you might be lonely by yourself or anything.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:24.260
I'll wrap you up in a tornado of embarrassment!

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.720
Mirakurun Hammer!

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:33.100
My skull caved in.

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:35.230
Behave yourself!

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:37.520
What are you doing?

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:41.320
Yui, I thought you were tired!

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:42.910
Not really.

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:43.690
Does it matter?

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:52.290
I bet you were lonely 'cause Akari's asleep.

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:53.620
Shut up, you idiot.

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:02.000
May this fun last forever.

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:10.090
Where did everyone go?

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:16.680
"Are yuru happy? Do yuru happy?" That's our motto.

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:24.360
This will be another exciting and happy day. Let's get going!

00:22:31.620 --> 00:22:33.580
I love taking breaks.

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:36.200
Lalala I wonder how far I can jump.

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:38.250
I'm a young girl in love.

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:40.620
Look, look, I have such an appetite.

00:22:40.620 --> 00:22:45.250
The future is fickle, filled with unpredictability and big news.

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:47.550
They're our after-school attractions.

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:52.600
Heigh-ho, heigh-ho, heigh-ho, heigh-ho.

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:56.890
Good luck to you anytime. What are you waiting for?

00:22:56.890 --> 00:22:57.930
We are the show.

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:02.520
There's a special rhythm, and the steps go "one, two, three".

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:04.860
We're abuzz with excitement one moment,

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:06.980
and depressed the next, but not for long.

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:11.860
Either way, we all know what we'll do, taking our time down the long path.

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:14.030
We're 100% students ~desu

00:23:14.030 --> 00:23:16.290
Yes! Get up, get up! Yuri Yuri!

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:18.410
Yes! Run, run, everyone!

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:20.790
Yes! Climb, climb, Yuru Yuri!

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:22.830
Yes! Everest!

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:27.380
"Are yuru happy? Do yuru happy?" That's our motto.

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:35.260
This will be another exciting and happy day. Let's get going!

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:43.730
Your protagonist Akaza Akari has returned.

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:46.480
I'm so happy to see all of you again!

00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:51.020
I'll stand out even more this time, so don't look away.

00:23:51.020 --> 00:23:52.860
All together, now.

00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:54.430
Akarin!
